- Basic data-quality constraints

Interpretation and Limitations

A successful test run indicates that the implemented tests passed for the data and code included in that run. It does not establish predictive accuracy, actuarial validity, regulatory compliance, or performance on real insurance portfolios.

The datasets used in this project are synthetic and intended for reproducible research and software validation.

Reproducibility

The automated workflow executes:

"python -m unittest discover -s tests -v"

The workflow is configured to run on pushes to "main" and pull requests targeting "main".